== Effects ==
* Grants a shield which nullifies a single hit once per floor.

== Notes ==
* The shield granted by Wooden Cross stacks with {{i|Holy Mantle}}, {{i|Blanket}}, and {{i|Dogma}}.
** {{dlc|nr+}} It does not, however, stack with the {{p|Holy Card}}; both are treated as the same shield.
** {{dlc|r+}} Shield-type items stack in the following order:
*** {{t|Wooden Cross}}
*** {{i|Blanket}}
*** {{i|Holy Mantle}}
*** {{p|Holy Card}}
*** {{i|Dogma}}
* The shield of Wooden Cross has a higher priority than Holy Mantle or Blanket and will be lost first when hit.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}} / {{t|Wooden Cross|r+}}: Gives Isaac two shields per floor.

